el and configuration. Discuss the target gas and operating conditions with the team.</p>",{"_142":494,"_139":377,"_378":495,"_380":381,"_382":496,"_384":497,"_386":387,"_388":389,"_390":498,"_392":499,"_394":500},"80c049fc-40ad-4323-9a25-c2cca9f27648","banner5.jpg",179706,"1a37cf51eb0d1214c061c8ba7603a9ebf13ba78e6de2501e0a99fadc4adf4436","/igenu-preview/media/1a37cf51eb0d1214c061c8ba.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.557Z",[501,503,505,507],{"_386":397,"_388":398,"_380":399,"_390":502},"/igenu-preview/media/1f5d3fc4303b503be10d1a7d.webp",{"_386":402,"_388":403,"_380":399,"_390":504},"/igenu-preview/media/f1c479027edd7c1eeb3cef4f.webp",{"_386":406,"_388":407,"_380":399,"_390":506},"/igenu-preview/media/64ad6ec0c7d8ae6a3937f3f9.webp",{"_386":387,"_388":389,"_380":399,"_390":508},"/igenu-preview/media/a68a1914bdb031107cff6a6c.webp",[267,298,299,306],"seo",{"_103":512,"_513":91,"_514":-5,"_515":516},"Instruments | IGENU SCIENCE","description","imageUrl","index",true,"canonical","https://eicloc.github.io/igenu-preview/en/products","query",{},"selected",[],{"_524":525,"_793":794,"_795":796,"_797":798,"_799":800},"items",[526,560,582,604,623,645,664,690,712,732,751,771],{"_142":158,"_57":527,"_528":529,"_530":531,"_532":533,"_534":516,"_146":535,"_538":539},"ig3000","model","IG3000","name","IG3000 Display Multichannel Controller","shortDescription","Bring compatible digital and analog water sensors together in a multichannel controller with a clear display and menu navigation. Configurable outputs, relays and communication options support process integration, while an output-hold function assists with sensor maintenance.","featured",{"_57":147,"_536":-5,"_530":109,"_513":-5,"_510":537},"brand",{"_103":109,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},"heroImage",{"_142":540,"_139":377,"_378":541,"_380":542,"_382":543,"_384":544,"_386":545,"_388":546,"_390":547,"_392":548,"_394":549},"d84d4b36-8577-47f5-a6b1-91a7ae3a7c9f","2025040855746689.png","image/png",749999,"8032374cce79b2ec8e8e37dca3798c3