oring, with air and sample calibration options for use in treatment, environmental and aquaculture applications.",{"_57":147,"_536":-5,"_530":109,"_513":-5,"_510":588},{"_103":109,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":590,"_139":377,"_378":591,"_380":381,"_382":592,"_384":593,"_386":594,"_388":595,"_390":596,"_392":597,"_394":598},"0ddcf618-0714-49aa-9919-74ce97332e9e","2025040860317013.png",19493,"1513162129cbcc0b7fb98e96f5e5a24329832e50befa0944e7b17725123db89a",458,293,"/igenu-preview/media/1513162129cbcc0b7fb98e96.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.769Z",[599,602],{"_386":397,"_388":600,"_380":399,"_390":601},205,"/igenu-preview/media/875a6bfa76d0d60b22d59c3d.webp",{"_386":594,"_388":595,"_380":399,"_390":603},"/igenu-preview/media/676768d13901a89005e95e68.webp",{"_142":211,"_57":605,"_528":606,"_530":607,"_532":608,"_534":516,"_146":609,"_538":611},"ig30ss-sol","IG30SS/SOL","IG30SS/SOL Suspended Solids and Sludge Concentration Sensor","Infrared scattered-light sensing monitors suspended solids and sludge concentration in water and wastewater processes. The digital probe combines optical compensation with a sapphire window, while an optional cleaning brush helps manage deposits during continuous monitoring at the measurement point.",{"_57":147,"_536":-5,"_530":109,"_513":-5,"_510":610},{"_103":109,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":612,"_139":377,"_378":613,"_380":381,"_382":614,"_384":615,"_386":616,"_388":617,"_390":618,"_392":619,"_394":620},"1439d80a-330c-424f-b53e-2863e4ad2437","2025040860527217.png",17952,"fbfabb8705ffee2ab2928de1e179bcbdfff9163bf9562b20f0a57da383e92447",252,303,"/igenu-preview/media/fbfabb8705ffee2ab2928de1.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.774Z",[621],{"_386":616,"_388":617,"_380":399,"_390":622},"/igenu-preview/media/75deeb09829c31a530ddf618.webp",{"_142":298,"_57":624,"_528":625,"_530":626,"_532":627,"_534":516,"_146":628,"_538":630},"ig8100","IG8100","IG8100 Fixed Gas Detector and Alarm","Configured for the required target gas, this fixed detector provides continuous concentration monitoring and local audible and visual alarms. Analog and digital outputs connect detection points with compatible control and monitoring systems in the selected installation.",{"_57":294,"_536":-5,"_530":116,"_513":-5,"_510":629},{"_103":116,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":631,"_139":377,"_378":632,"_380":381,"_382":633,"_384":634,"_386":635,"_388":636,"_390":637,"_392":638,"_394":639},"a55ad70e-9d54-462e-a2ea-a827378021aa","2018040281324785.jpg",50456,"839a34011d33d0b03a4d61735b7686e5645b3091e52bd34545f51bda446373d6",339,243,"/igenu-preview/media/839a34011d33d0b03a4d6173.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.606Z",[640,643],{"_386":397,"_388":641,"_380":399,"_390":642},229,"/igenu-preview/media/6d839fb13c7f64d9a04f573f.webp",{"_386":635,"_388":636,"_380":399,"_390":644},"/igenu-preview/media/023755c71cd1c8e5ab08db45.webp",{"_142":246,"_57":646,"_528":647,"_530":648,"_532":649,"_534":516,"_146":650,"_538":652},"ig30uvno3","IG30UVNO3","IG30UVNO3 UV Nitrate Nitrogen Sensor","Ultraviolet absorption measures nitrate nitrogen directly in water without chemical reagents or a separate sampling system. Selectable optical paths, interference compensation and automatic cleaning support online deployment in drinking water, environmental monitoring and wastewater treatment applications.",{"_57":147,"_536":-5,"_530":109,"_513":-5,"_510":651},{"_103":109,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":653,"_139":377,"_378":654,"_380":381,"_382":655,"_384":656,"_386":657,"_388":658,"_390":659,"_392":660,"_394":661},"79581a81-10c6-426b-80fa-28e7baf03c33","2025040861391349.png",16873,"82c04b6460e5738541de5cfefb589dc0c6890e78350a89fe4e1a3b1a0828a745",263,348,"/igenu-preview/media/82c04b6460e5738541de5cfe.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.799Z",[662],{"_386":657,"_388":658,"_380":399,"_390":663},"/igenu-preview/media/5668d414b7362883ab524969.webp",{"_142":266,"_57":665,"_528":666,"_530":667,"_532":668,"_534":669,"_146":670,"_538":672},"ig1000","IG1000","IG1000 Electromagnetic Flowmeter","Electromagnetic flow sensing measures conductive liquids, including water and process slurries. Inline installation and electrical outputs support integration into process monitoring, with material and connection options selected to suit the application and the measured medium.",false,{"_57":262,"_536":-5,"_530":113,"_513":-5,"_510":671},{"_103":113,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":673,"_139":377,"_378":674,"_380":381,"_382":675,"_384":676,"_386":677,"_388":678,"_390":679,"_392":680,"_394":681},"ae088e5b-dee3-4d64-a813-8aea3d5faa40","2018040280914617.jpg",79233,"2a75c1e35c4f5d26d0d45a78e4afd1e32e7fc5846f14595ed04ad41691e1ba5a",775,522,"/igenu-preview/media/2a75c1e35c4f5d26d0d45a78.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.599Z",[682,685,688],{"_386":397,"_388":683,"_380":399,"_390":684},216,"/igenu-preview/media/b9d84e037e2e93e539dbc230.webp",{"_386":402,"_388":686,"_380":399,"_390":687},431,"/igenu-preview/media/34a2de4913f859e3b5fd7093.webp",{"_386":677,"_388":678,"_380":399,"_390":689},"/igenu-preview/media/f7cba31a9a75d0b97c8bfde5.webp",{"_142":202,"_57":691,"_528":692,"_530":693,"_532":694,"_534":669,"_146":695,"_538":697},"ig3000lt","IG3000LT","IG3000LT Low-Range Turbidity Analyzer","Designed for low-level turbidity measurement in drinking water and treatment systems, this analyzer combines optical detection with a flow cell that removes bubbles. Its modular arrangement supports calibration, cleaning and servicing, with temperature displayed alongside turbidity.",{"_57":147,"_536":-5,"_530":109,"_513":-5,"_510":696},{"_103":109,"_513":-5,"_514":-5,"_515":516},{"_142":698,"_139":377,"_378":699,"_380":542,"_382":700,"_384":701,"_386":702,"_388":703,"_390":704,"_392":705,"_394":706},"257d01fc-7670-46be-af54-0ae68bffbc45","2025040860761681.jpg",133072,"32687b0fb7e3209190a365f6165fd1befe9616a983cc291c12aca450fcae88b2",327,551,"/igenu-preview/media/32687b0fb7e3209190a365f6.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.781Z",[707,710],{"_386":397,"_388":708,"_380":399,"_39